  "name": "PropelAuth",
  "abstract": "Authentication platform from the USA built for B2B products. Hosted login and account pages with password, magic link, social login and TOTP or SMS 2FA, organizations as a core object with invitations and RBAC, self-service SAML and OIDC enterprise SSO, and SCIM directory sync. It also covers end-user and organization API keys, user impersonation, audit logs, and OAuth 2.1 authentication for MCP servers. PropelAuth can act as an OIDC provider. BYO Auth is a self-hosted sidecar that adds SSO and SCIM to an existing auth stack. The Free plan covers 10,000 MAUs and unlimited organizations. SOC 2 Type 2 certified.",
